@startuml
title RF11 — Central de carreiras salvas · Máquina de estados: CareerSave.status
skinparam StateBackgroundColor #FFF7EE
skinparam StateBorderColor #DC5B26
state "Em criação (RF34)" as NEW
NEW : assistente: mundo, liga, franquia, estilo de head coach
state "ACTIVE" as ACTIVE
ACTIVE : ocupa slot (máx. 5)
ACTIVE : jogável
state "ARCHIVED" as ARCHIVED
ARCHIVED : não conta no limite
ARCHIVED : somente leitura até reativar
state "Excluído" as DELETED
DELETED : save, mundo SAVE e projeções removidos
[*] --> NEW
NEW --> ACTIVE : 201 · mundo clonado, temporada gerada
NEW --> DELETED : cancela assistente
ACTIVE --> ARCHIVED : PATCH ARCHIVED (sem partida ao vivo)
ARCHIVED --> ACTIVE : PATCH ACTIVE (slot livre)
ACTIVE --> DELETED : DELETE confirmado
ARCHIVED --> DELETED : DELETE confirmado
DELETED --> [*]
@enduml
